ELIXPO LICENSE
==============

This repository is part of the Elixpo ecosystem and is licensed under the
Elixpo licensing standard, the same standard that applies to every Elixpo
repository. Product-specific terms for this repository are declared in the
NOTICE file at the repository root (the "notice board"), which must be read
together with this LICENSE.

The LICENSES/ directory holds the canonical texts; this file is the pointer.

This repository is tree-sitter-plum, the Tree-sitter grammar for Plumlang:
the grammar, its external scanner, the generated parser, the editor queries,
the language bindings and the tests.

CODE
====

All code in this repository (grammar.js, src/ including the generated
parser, queries/, bindings/, test/, script/, the build and package files,
and the workflows under .github/) is provided under:

	SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT WITH Plumlang-trademarks

Being under the terms of the MIT License, as set out in:

	LICENSES/preferred/MIT

The package manifests (package.json, Cargo.toml, pyproject.toml) declare
"MIT", the licence of the files; the exception below adds no conditions on
the code and only reserves names and marks.

